==Battleground==
*10 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*2 [[Zomboe]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ghost Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**1 [[Zir Zeal]] spawns.
**2 [[Zigge]]s spawn, delay 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
**2 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The threat here comes from the Shy Boys, and yet their presence can be completely mitigated by [[Fried Shrimp Cat]]. If you lack them, then you can just spam meatshields, as [[Crazed Bahamut Cat]] takes care of them, or [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie]] if you lack C. Bahamut.

